    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like i'm \"questioning\" it. it feels like i'm just witnessing it happen all over again. every time i think i'm making progress, i just fall back into the same ruts they did. it's like i'm just a vessel for all their trauma and failure. if i actually succeeded in changing things, i'd probably just be a fluke, but the reality is i'm just part of the cycle. it feels like the cycle is the only thing that's actually real.",
