      "content": "i don't know if i want to \"believe\" my path is different. what if it isn't? what if the only way to actually stop the pattern is to just stop being a part of it? like, if i'm the one carrying all this, then if i'm gone, the cycle finally hits a wall. it feels like the most selfless thing i could do is just be the one to end the line so it doesn't pass to anyone else.",
